WEBVTT

00:01:58.996 --> 00:02:01.116
to turn ideas into action.

00:02:01.436 --> 00:02:03.316
Because in spite of all the challenges,

00:02:03.316 --> 00:02:06.476
people never stop trying
to shift mindsets

00:02:06.556 --> 00:02:08.836
and then entire systems.

00:02:08.836 --> 00:02:12.116
Alok Sharma: Investors,
they think the future is green.

00:02:12.156 --> 00:02:14.716
Hindou Oumarou Ibrahim:
We have 10 years to change it,

00:02:14.796 --> 00:02:17.916
so we need to act all together right now.

00:02:17.916 --> 00:02:20.956
DC: To change the way we move
ourselves and our economy.

00:02:20.996 --> 00:02:23.476
Nigel Topping: Transformation
in every global system,

00:02:23.596 --> 00:02:25.396
from agriculture to retail,

00:02:25.436 --> 00:02:27.516
shipping to trucking, cement to steel.

00:02:27.516 --> 00:02:29.836
DC: And the very foundations
upon which we live.

00:02:29.836 --> 00:02:33.636
Monica Araya: A big detox
of transportation is possible.